1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,186
Tessmouth United 4, Vantry Town 3:
one simulated match.

2
00:00:04,236 --> 00:00:08,125
Pivot finds the moments that turned it,
explains why,

3
00:00:08,175 --> 00:00:11,550
and lets you replay it
with one thing changed.

4
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,472
Pivot found three turning points.

5
00:00:14,522 --> 00:00:17,617
Take the 12th minute,
when Vantry took over.

6
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:21,044
A Judge agent confirms
it really swung the game.

7
00:00:21,094 --> 00:00:22,782
An Explainer writes why.

8
00:00:22,832 --> 00:00:26,631
A Verifier recomputes every number
from the event log:

9
00:00:26,681 --> 00:00:30,550
Vantry's passes into the final third
went from 4 to 14.

10
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:34,051
Now switch to Fan
and pick Tessmouth.

11
00:00:34,101 --> 00:00:38,256
Same moment, same checked facts,
told from your side:

12
00:00:38,306 --> 00:00:42,383
"Tessmouth United lose control
after Vantry's goal."

13
00:00:42,433 --> 00:00:44,550
In Chinese or Spanish, too.

14
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,400
Follow a player.

15
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:51,450
Sahaltessen scored a hat-trick,
the first from the penalty spot,

16
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,828
and is rated 9.9.

17
00:00:52,878 --> 00:00:56,550
You get his shots, his heatmap
and his passing.

18
00:00:57,150 --> 00:01:01,791
So what if Vantry's opening penalty
had been ruled out?

19
00:01:01,841 --> 00:01:08,169
Pivot saves the match at that minute
and plays the rest 200 times each way.

20
00:01:08,219 --> 00:01:13,112
Tessmouth's chance of winning rises
from 34 to 50 percent.

21
00:01:13,162 --> 00:01:17,550
Those ranges don't overlap.
It's a clear difference.

22
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:20,987
Every match replays on the pitch,

23
00:01:21,037 --> 00:01:25,508
with passes, shots and tackles
drawn as they happen.

24
00:01:25,558 --> 00:01:28,481
Set pieces too: on this free kick,

25
00:01:28,531 --> 00:01:34,550
five attackers faced all eleven Vantry players,
with five in the wall.

26
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:41,209
Before kick-off: four wins in five for Tessmouth,
five draws for Vantry,

27
00:01:41,259 --> 00:01:45,550
a cup semi-final days later,
and each coach's plan.

28
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:48,807
The agents run on Azure AI Foundry.

29
00:01:48,857 --> 00:01:52,730
Results live in Cosmos DB,
matches in Blob Storage.

30
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:55,437
Every club and player is synthetic.

31
00:01:55,487 --> 00:01:56,550
This is Pivot.
